# Wave T39 (Perennial kit): badgeroof — the Perennial League
# hall's roof kind, worn by its four tr cells only. Pale
# marble shingle courses carrying a FRIEZE BAND near the
# crown: eight coloured gem studs in a line on gold — the
# Conference's eight badges as abstract studs of colour (no
# iconography copied). No other roof in the fleet carries a
# frieze; the marble courses keep the town style's own roof
# register (marble blues and ivory). (NO-SAME-KIT law;
# WAVE-T39-PERENNIAL-PLAN.md.)
